      "t": "2026-11-10T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "A third round of United States-mediated talks between Ukrainian and Russian delegations opens in Abu Dhabi, focusing on humanitarian impact, prisoners of war and security guarantees.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-10:1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-10T00:00:08Z",
      "text": "The third round started on 10 November 2026, following earlier trilateral rounds in late January and early February.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1385215000:2",
        "wiki:rev:1385215000:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-10T00:00:15Z",
      "text": "Earlier that day, the American and Ukrainian teams met separately with representatives of France, Germany, Italy, the United Kingdom, the European Commission and NATO.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-10:1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-10T00:00:25Z",
      "text": "The talks are taking place in Abu Dhabi, in the United Arab Emirates.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-10:1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-10T00:00:33Z",
      "text": "Reported by AP, DW and The Guardian.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-10:1"
      ]
